    scripts/eval/run-evals.ts,exec via execFileSync argv + isMain guard + lib serializeToon/atomicWriteText; tier dispatch total over t1/t2/t3,clean
    scripts/eval/tiers/t1-static.ts,no exec/eval/child_process; pure in-process static checks (free-by-default C-03 upheld),clean
    scripts/eval/tiers/t2-hermetic.ts,reads fixtures only; llmCalls invariantly 0; missing fixture => EVAL_FIXTURE_MISSING exit 1 (no silent pass),clean
    scripts/eval/tiers/t3-judge.ts,advisory-only; judge injected via seam (no live call in tests); floor regression is warn-not-block; always exit 0,clean
    skills/loom-canary/rollback-gate.ts,fail-closed on empty probe batch and first non-2xx/threshold breach; no "mostly healthy" promotion,clean
    skills/loom-retro/append-guard.ts,append-only prefix check + sequential id allocation; rejects shrink/mutation of historic rows,clean
  findings[0]{id,file,severity,blocking,summary}:
  blockingCount: 0

